@OData_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136

### Get all events
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events
Accept: application/json

###

### Get single event by key
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events(1)
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by EventDate (equals)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=Id%20eq%2010
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by EventDate (equals)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=EventDate%20eq%202025-12-05
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by EventDate (greater than or equal)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=EventDate%20ge%202025-12-01
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by EventDate (month function)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=month(EventDate)%20eq%2012
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by StartTime (equals)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=StartTime%20eq%2013:00:00
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by StartTime (less than)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=StartTime%20lt%2010:00:00
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by EndTime (minute function)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=minute(EndTime)%20eq%2030
Accept: application/json

###

### Order by EventDate descending and StartTime
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$orderby=EventDate%20desc,%20StartTime
Accept: application/json

###

### Select specific properties
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$select=Title,EventDate,StartTime
Accept: application/json

###

### Top 1 event
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$top=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Skip 1 event
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$skip=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Count events
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$count=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by nullable property (has value)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=RegistrationDeadline%20ne%20null
Accept: application/json

###

### Combined query: filter, orderby, select
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events?$filter=EventDate%20ge%202025-11-01&$orderby=StartTime&$select=Title,Location,StartTime
Accept: application/json

###

### Create new event (POST)
POST {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Test Event",
    "Location": "Online",
    "EventDate": "2025-05-15",
    "StartTime": "20:30:59.0010100",
    "EndTime": "08:30:59.0010000",
    "RegistrationDeadline": "2025-05-01",
    "DoorOpenTime": "20:00:00",
    "AlternateDates": ["2025-05-15", "2025-05-16"],
    "SessionTimes": ["20:30:59.0010100", "08:30:59.0010000", "21:31:59"]
}

###

### Create event with minimal data
POST {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Quick Meeting",
    "Location": "Conference Room A",
    "EventDate": "2025-06-10",
    "StartTime": "14:00:00",
    "EndTime": "15:00:00"
}

###

### Custom function: GetEventsInDateRange
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events/GetEventsInDateRange(startDate=2025-11-01,endDate=2025-12-31,preferredTime=10:00:00)
Accept: application/json

###

### Custom function: GetEventsInDateRange (without preferred time)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events/GetEventsInDateRange(startDate=2025-11-01,endDate=2025-12-31,preferredTime=null)
Accept: application/json

###

### Custom function: GetEventsInDateRange (narrow range)
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/Events/GetEventsInDateRange(startDate=2025-12-01,endDate=2025-12-10,preferredTime=13:00:00)
Accept: application/json

###

### Get OData metadata
GET {{OData_HostAddress}}/odata/$metadata
Accept: application/xml

###
